- `src/components/chat/Chat.vue` was updated upstream: it now accepts a `hideFilesHeader` prop (mobile header collapse) and wraps the files/profiles `Collapsible` in `v-if="!hideFilesHeader"`.
- The attachment-persistence fix (in-flight `FileReader` tasks + awaiting the save in edit mode) must be re-applied on top of that new version.
- Verified against the current file: `attachmentTasks`, `onUploadFiles()` task tracking, `flushPendingAttachments()`, the `await`-ed `updateMessage()` with error containment, and the `await this.flushPendingAttachments()` in `addNewMessage()` are all present alongside the new `hideFilesHeader` prop. No conflicting hunks.

